         complementing the coarse full-access permissions in
         pos_retail_access_permission_data.xml. Generated mechanically; the
         access rows are standalone records for the same reasons as there
         (explicit names, own xmlids, clean uninstall). -->

    <record id="perm_partners_create" model="pos.retail.access.permission">
